+| `codemie` (SSO) | browser SSO → `codemie_access_token` JWT Bearer (random callback port, base64 `token` carries session cookies; re-login refreshes, keeps last-used model). Guided project → model pick runs on EVERY connect — a re-login leads the picker with a keep-current row; the picked project persists on the saved entry and rides requests as `x-codemie-project` (issue #1809). **Project contract (issue #1941):** the selected project must ride EVERY model request — chat, `/llm_models`, quota — and every model rebuild (boot/session restore, roles-chain failover, settings + `/model` switches) re-resolves it from the saved entry; a request WITHOUT `x-codemie-project` is billed against the user's DEFAULT project by the backend, even though the UI shows the picked one | same as manual + `x-codemie-project` header | `/llm_models?include_all=true` (LiteLLM) — `_refreshModelCache` branches on `code-assistant-api` marker |
